# NEVER COMMIT THE DATASET.
# output/ and site/ contain IEEE paper metadata and abstracts. Republishing
# that on a public GitHub repo is a copyright problem, so the repo carries
# SCRIPTS ONLY. The dataset is private and travels via iCloud.
# (It is also ~400 MB and fully regenerable by running update.bat.)
output/
site/
cache/

# Your marks (likes / marks / notes). Personal data, synced through iCloud
# rather than git, so the repo never carries a merge conflict over it.
# Track it instead if you want a second sync path - see ONGOING.md.
userdata/

# Vendored MathJax (third-party, Apache-2.0). 4 MB of upstream bundle that the
# build fetches by itself when missing, so it does not belong in a repo that
# carries scripts only.
assets/mathjax/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# Reference PDFs (large binaries, not source)
*.pdf

# OS / editor
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/

# topic surveys: work/ and out/ hold IEEE titles and abstracts (AGENTS rule 2)  [c]
surveys/*/work/
surveys/*/out/

# Curated per-paper lists and copied programme text: dataset, not script (2026-11-02)  [c]
data/session_overrides.tsv
data/vlsi_technology_papers.txt
/esscirc20*.txt
/session_*.txt
scratch/_agent-out-*.md
